    "tpa_score_new": "<div>課堂表現 - 10% 期中考 - 25% 期末考- 35% 作業 - 30% (on 2&nbsp;assignments)</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "1. 準時到課並簽到，出席情形將納入學期成績計算。\n2. 尊重其他同學上課權益，可於課程中舉手發問，但請勿在課堂中喧嘩嬉鬧。\n3. 課程進行時，請將行動電話調整至靜音模式。",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>The homework assignments will be given in class at least four weeks before the due dates on the schedule. <em>No homework is accepted after the start of class on the due date for any reason whatever</em>. Homework must be neat,<em> </em>concise and clear. Use A4 paper and write on one side only (recycled white<em> </em>paper is acceptable). Students are expected to work independently. Be<em> </em>responsible to your own work.</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": null
  },
